        "created_at": "2024-11-23T19:08:04.956Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am writing to seek your assistance regarding an issue I am facing with the BPT VM assignments for the System Commands course. I am currently repeating the full course this term, as I could not attend the end-term exam last term.</p>\n<p>During the last term, I completed the BPT VM assignments and qualified for them. However, when I attempt to access the BPT assignments for this term, I notice that the submissions from the previous term are still showing up. Moreover, when I check the marks for this term, my portal indicates that I am marked as “absent.”</p>\n<p>Could you please assist me in resolving this issue and clarify why my assignment submission from the previous term is being considered, and how I can ensure that my marks for this term are correctly reflected?</p>\n<p>I would greatly appreciate your help in sorting this matter out.</p>\n<p>Thank you for your time and support.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
